		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>La fonction grant_lob_access_to_ro exécute:</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code> UPDATE pg_largeobject_metadata                                 
 SET lomacl =&#039;{user=rw........}&#039;             
 WHERE oid = NEW.blob;                                          
 RETURN NEW;    </code></pre></div>]]></content>
