		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Hello ! <br />Merci d&#039;avoir pris la peine de répondre </p><p>Voici plus de détail de la table:</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code> id 				| bigint |                 | not null  |            | plain    |                       
 blob                         | oid    |                  | not null  |            | plain    |                       
Index :
    &quot;lob_pkey&quot; PRIMARY KEY, btree (id)
Triggers :
    lob_lo_unlink AFTER DELETE ON my_table FOR EACH ROW EXECUTE FUNCTION delete_lo()
    lob_ro_access AFTER INSERT OR UPDATE ON my_table FOR EACH ROW EXECUTE FUNCTION grant_lob_access_to_ro()</code></pre></div><p>Merci</p>]]></content>
